{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/68e0436735858482d43b09cea75d87b8.poster.avif?t=1767618367\" width=624 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/68e0436735858482d43b09cea75d87b8.webm?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/68e0436735858482d43b09cea75d87b8.mp4?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M.E.A.T. II Absolute Zero (MEAT 2) is a first-person shooter representing the so-called <strong>\u201cboomer shooter\u201d</strong> genre. The FPS, keeping with the spirit of the series, maintains a pixel art graphical style referring to retro games. At the same time the game is enriched with additional solutions, thanks to which you can also feel a breath of gaming freshness. The whole game is permeated with an awe-inspiring, even brutal atmosphere - dark locations, enemies taken straight out of nightmarish visions, and finally - heavy music. All this completes the final effect, which will certainly not leave you indifferent. The same goes for the plot - <strong>following the first part of the M.E.A.T. series</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/caf3849a809b427639fc6cf030ae3fb4.poster.avif?t=1767618367\" width=624 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/caf3849a809b427639fc6cf030ae3fb4.webm?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/caf3849a809b427639fc6cf030ae3fb4.mp4?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/b3e6a7510f22674b79adb18747ee813b.avif?t=1767618367\" width=627 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game presents the further fate of Sir Duncan H. Culligan, who, despite the tragedies he encountered on his way, does not give up. The death of his wife, the epidemic that gradually turned into a terrifying festival of grotesque citizen-murdering creatures, the closure of mining shafts and the further loss of loved ones. It would seem to be too much for one man. <strong>Nothing could be further from the truth.</strong> After all, the Cannon of Light has not yet dealt with all the evil consuming this 19th century Canadian town. This time, the dark sect MBSXII poses as the main antagonist, using the Rock Resin to prepare an even greater disaster. What\u2019s important however - a disaster threatening further than the known world reaches... Culligan, however, does not give in to any adversity and takes matters - or rather, guns - into his own hands. The wrath of Washagami chief protector will have to undergo another test, and the telestarion-powered weaponry will become his messenger. For the time  of revenge has come. Revenge that takes no prisoners. <strong>A revenge painted with blood.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/1f3391acb36393043c59ac180539236b.poster.avif?t=1767618367\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/1f3391acb36393043c59ac180539236b.webm?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/cf821a693c8fb81412d258660e71cac8.avif?t=1767618367\" width=627 height=277 /></span>Familiar opponents, but also meny new faces.<strong> Fearsome creatures of deformed bodies</strong> will try to end Sir Culligan's life in many twisted ways. There is, however, a sizable supply of anger and telestarion in his possession, making it possible to confront the enemy. To not just find the enemy, but exact his revenge by<strong> cutting, perforating and tearing out the guts</strong> of everything the sect has hidden in its headquarters corridors. That is what your task shall be!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/439d899293876c13812eb202d0bfde76.poster.avif?t=1767618367\" width=624 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/439d899293876c13812eb202d0bfde76.webm?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/439d899293876c13812eb202d0bfde76.mp4?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game refers to the classic installments of its genre, so there will be no shortage of <strong>secret levels, hidden boss battles and a whole lot of easter eggs</strong> for fans of both pop culture and the M.E.A.T. world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress will be saved automatically and manually so that you won't lose any of the racked up kills or the ammo-stuffed gun you've just collected. You won't have to worry that a secret item found with difficulty will disappear from your arsenal. Instead of being distracted by it you\u2019ll be instead<strong> able to fully focus on your murderous crusade</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/96cab28c027175d814c4719dd3cb030c.poster.avif?t=1767618367\" width=624 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/96cab28c027175d814c4719dd3cb030c.webm?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/96cab28c027175d814c4719dd3cb030c.mp4?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire story will be presented in narrated cutscenes, which will add a layer of cinematics to the action-packed shooter. This will not only allow you to get to know the whole story in a more accessible way, but will also finally answer the nagging question: <strong>what does the M.E.A.T. abbreviation stand for?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/a7018e67e1e2fa2900780d4f0e7f939d.poster.avif?t=1767618367\" width=624 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/a7018e67e1e2fa2900780d4f0e7f939d.webm?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/a7018e67e1e2fa2900780d4f0e7f939d.mp4?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/fb2629ad58340f13fa52cec85e63757d.avif?t=1767618367\" width=627 height=277 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/d4d2c8a9dd57e3bc4537be653084176f.poster.avif?t=1767618367\" width=624 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/d4d2c8a9dd57e3bc4537be653084176f.webm?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/d4d2c8a9dd57e3bc4537be653084176f.mp4?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M.E.A.T. II Absolute Zero (MEAT 2) offers<strong> a free demo that will shed some light on the upcoming full release</strong>. Discover the beginning of Sir Culligan's new, blood-curdling adventure full of blown-up enemies, juicy bullet holes and mysterious locations hiding more than one puzzle. All this is complemented by energetic voiceover, with the shouts of rappers S\u0142o\u0144 and Skits of Dutch group DOPE D.O.D. cheering you on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/8aff4ea6d15fb28afabf5c0d033bbc7d.poster.avif?t=1767618367\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/8aff4ea6d15fb28afabf5c0d033bbc7d.webm?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interested? Add M.E.A.T. II: Absolute Zero (MEAT 2) to your Wishlist now so you don't miss the release! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early access: Q4 2025</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release: Q4 2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/1460f4ee408285e5bf4bd43629c7a6e6.poster.avif?t=1767618367\" width=606 height=231 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176710/extras/1460f4ee408285e5bf4bd43629c7a6e6.webm?t=1767618367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Indian Legends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176710/3e34d79fcc449baf26ab2839aeb90edc120f5f6a.jpg"},{"name":"Precision Fury","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176710/14e789d1d8dbf531e6b283af013cb0ad51a0218f.jpg"},{"name":"Precision Fury 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176710/14e789d1d8dbf531e6b283af013cb0ad51a0218f.jpg"},{"name":"Precision Fury 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176710/14e789d1d8dbf531e6b283af013cb0ad51a0218f.jpg"},{"name":"Precision Fury 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176710/14e789d1d8dbf531e6b283af013cb0ad51a0218f.jpg"},{"name":"Precision Fury 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176710/14e789d1d8dbf531e6b283af013cb0ad51a0218f.jpg"},{"name":"Precision Fury 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176710/14e789d1d8dbf531e6b283af013cb0ad51a0218f.jpg"},{"name":"Eagle Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176710/501292aa99be56a58be527b7d123adb4c5afe7ee.jpg"},{"name":"Eagle Eye 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176710/501292aa99be56a58be527b7d123adb4c5afe7ee.jpg"},{"name":"Eagle Eye 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.